# term in a test build (roadmap os-server.md P12): COM2 carries the
# kernel's log, so /dev/com2 is busy and there is no terminal. A release
# build makes COM2 the modem's line.
program: sh
install: C /BIN/TERM z-term.rx
keys: term\n
---
rx286, test build
/mnt/rx286$ term
COM2 carries the kernel's log in this build; a release build
makes it the modem's line.
/mnt/rx286$
